{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 block called "Vertical Timeline Accordion" with a premium, interactive design. Full requirements:
    
    Layout & Frame: Each timeline entry must have a visible card frame (rounded corners 12px, subtle border 1px solid #ece9e3, soft box-shadow 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)) wrapping the content. Inside each card: an optional image (full-width, object-fit: cover, max-height 220px, border-radius 8px), a date/year label (uppercase, spaced, muted), a title, and a description. Generous internal padding (1.5rem 1.75rem).
    
    Timeline line: A vertical connector line (1px, color #d4d0cb) runs on the left side through all entries. Each entry has a dot/circle marker. The dot is fully configurable via theme editor settings: size (range 8–32px, default 14px), fill color, border color, and border width (1–4px). Dot position is centered on the line. When an entry becomes visible via scroll, optionally apply a pulse animation (configurable: pulse / none).
    
    Scroll-reveal: Each entry uses IntersectionObserver (no external libraries) to fade in (opacity 0→1) and slide up (translateY 20px→0) with 0.5s ease transition. Entries animate sequentially — only when they enter the viewport.
    
    Accordion behavior: Only the first entry is visible by default. All remaining entries are hidden (display: none). A "Ver más" button appears below, centered, styled as a pill (border-radius: 999px, border: 1px solid #ccc, uppercase, spaced text). The chevron arrow icon is placed below the button text (stacked vertically using flex-direction: column), not inline. On click: hidden entries are shown one by one with a staggered reveal (80ms delay per entry index) using IntersectionObserver. Button label changes to "Ver menos" and chevron rotates 180°. Clicking again collapses all extra entries and resets their visibility state.
    
    Style: Minimalist and editorial. Clean sans-serif typography. Neutral palette. Premium spa-like feel with generous whitespace. No decorative elements beyond the timeline line and dots.
    
    Theme editor settings:
    
    Section heading (text)
    Dot size (range: 8–32px, step 2, default 14px)
    Dot color (color picker, default #2a2a2a)
    Dot border color (color picker, default #d4d0cb)
    Dot border width (range: 1–4px, step 1, default 2px)
    Dot animation (select: none / pulse)
    Up to 6 timeline entries as nested blocks (type: timeline_entry), each with: image_picker, date/year text, entry title, entry description (textarea)
    Technical requirements:
    
    All JS scoped inside an IIFE using block.id (converted to safe variable name) so multiple instances work independently on the same page
    CSS inside a scoped <style> tag using #tl-{{ bid }} as root selector with CSS custom properties for dot size, color, border
    Pulse animation defined as a scoped @keyframes block, only injected when dot_animation == 'pulse' (using Liquid {% if %})
    No external JS or CSS dependencies
    Compatible with Shopify OS 2.0 (block schema with "target": "section", "presets" array, max 6 blocks)
    Schema at the bottom of the file in {% schema %} JSON... el bloque tiene j  problema y es quw duando le das a ver mas, no se muestran las demas tarjetas, corrigele y tambien añade opciones de personalizacion estetica, tamaño y posiciónamiento a todos los elementos, tambien al ver mas
{% enddoc %}
{% assign bid = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  #tl-{{ bid }} {
    --dot-size: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    --dot-color: {{ block.settings.dot_color }};
    --dot-border-color: {{ block.settings.dot_border_color }};
    --dot-border-width: {{ block.settings.dot_border_width }}px;
    --line-color: {{ block.settings.line_color }};
    --card-bg: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    --card-border-color: {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    --card-border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    --card-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_h }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_v }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_color }};
    --date-color: {{ block.settings.date_color }};
    --title-color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    --desc-color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    --btn-bg: {{ block.settings.button_bg }};
    --btn-text: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    --btn-border: {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    --btn-hover-bg: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
    --btn-hover-text: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    --btn-hover-border: {{ block.settings.button_hover_border_color }};
    --btn-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    --btn-padding-v: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px;
    --btn-padding-h: {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    --btn-font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    --btn-letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
    --chevron-size: {{ block.settings.chevron_size }}px;
    --chevron-spacing: {{ block.settings.chevron_spacing }}px;
    
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-heading-{{ bid }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-container-{{ bid }} {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.timeline_offset }}px;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-line-{{ bid }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background-color: var(--line-color);
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-entry-{{ bid }} {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.entry_spacing }}px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-entry-{{ bid }}.tl-visible-{{ bid }} {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-entry-{{ bid }}.tl-hidden-{{ bid }} {
    display: none;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-dot-{{ bid }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1 * {{ block.settings.timeline_offset }}px);
    top: {{ block.settings.dot_vertical_position }}px;
    width: var(--dot-size);
    height: var(--dot-size);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--dot-color);
    border: var(--dot-border-width) solid var(--dot-border-color);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  {% if block.settings.dot_animation == 'pulse' %}
    @keyframes tl-pulse-{{ bid }} {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1);
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.2);
        opacity: 0.8;
      }
    }

    #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-entry-{{ bid }}.tl-visible-{{ bid }} .tl-dot-{{ bid }} {
      animation: tl-pulse-{{ bid }} 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  {% endif %}

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-card-{{ bid }} {
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border-color);
    border-radius: var(--card-border-radius);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-image-{{ bid }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: {{ block.settings.image_max_height }}px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-date-{{ bid }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.date_font_size }}px;
    color: var(--date-color);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.date_letter_spacing }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.date_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-title-{{ bid }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    color: var(--title-color);
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font_weight }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.title_margin_bottom }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-desc-{{ bid }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    color: var(--desc-color);
    line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height }};
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-toggle-wrapper-{{ bid }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.button_alignment }};
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.button_margin_top }}px;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-toggle-{{ bid }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--chevron-spacing);
    background-color: var(--btn-bg);
    color: var(--btn-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--btn-border);
    border-radius: var(--btn-radius);
    padding: var(--btn-padding-v) var(--btn-padding-h);
    font-size: var(--btn-font-size);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--btn-letter-spacing);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-toggle-{{ bid }}:hover {
    background-color: var(--btn-hover-bg);
    color: var(--btn-hover-text);
    border-color: var(--btn-hover-border);
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-chevron-{{ bid }} {
    width: var(--chevron-size);
    height: var(--chevron-size);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-toggle-{{ bid }}.tl-expanded-{{ bid }} .tl-chevron-{{ bid }} {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #tl-{{ bid }} {
      width: 100%;
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal | times: 0.7 }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-container-{{ bid }} {
      padding-left: {{ block.settings.timeline_offset | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-dot-{{ bid }} {
      left: calc(-1 * {{ block.settings.timeline_offset | times: 0.7 }}px);
    }

    #tl-{{ bid }} .tl-card-{{ bid }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

